To install Webots to run the simulation, run this in the terminal:
curl -L -O https://github.com/cyberbotics/webots/releases/download/R2025a/webots-R2025a.dmg

Install numpy in order for you to have the correct library's for the code:
brew install numpy

worlds -> marvic_2_pro.wbt contains the information about the drones starting position

Webots -> preferences -> Python command is where you put the path for python so that Webots can run